      "kind": "action",
      "title": "Track bounded work",
      "description": "Before endpoint authorization, the preHandler resolves the session and limits work to sixteen global and four per-session requests; finish/close releases the slot. Direct comparison SnapshotService calls share the already-admitted parent request.",
